# 20. INCREMENTAL ANALYSIS

Implement incremental source indexing.

Track:

- File path
- File hash
- Last modification time
- Extracted symbols
- Dependent symbols
- Analysis version

When a source file changes:

1. Detect the modification.
2. Reparse the file.
3. Update class and method metadata.
4. Remove obsolete relationships.
5. Re-resolve impacted symbols.
6. Update graph storage.
7. Refresh affected metrics.
8. Invalidate affected caches.

Avoid complete project reindexing when unnecessary.

Support manual full reindexing.

